  1045	// External vector path — DREAM_EMBED_MODE shadow A/B.
  1046	//
  1047	// `searchMemory` dispatches based on $DREAM_EMBED_MODE:
  1048	//
  1049	//   qmd (default)  serve qmd, no shadow                              (today)
  1050	//   shadow         serve qmd, sample-log shadow vs sidecar /search
  1051	//   shadow-tei     serve sidecar /search, sample-log shadow vs qmd
  1052	//   tei            serve sidecar /search only                        (cutover)
